6. Separate commercial permission

Commercial Use is not licensed by this document. Before starting it, obtain a
separate written commercial agreement from Christian Klose (GitHub: ChrisDelClea)
and pay the license fee required by that agreement. Christian Klose may grant
only rights he owns or has been authorized to sublicense. Separate third-party
license obligations remain applicable.

The current commercial licensing policy and EUR 20,000 price are documented in
COMMERCIAL-LICENSING.md. That policy is an invitation to negotiate a defined
license, not an automatic offer of unlimited rights. Payment, a donation,
submitting a contribution, or opening an issue alone does not grant a commercial
license. The agreement must state the licensed scope and when its rights begin.

7. Duration, violations, and existing rights

Permissions for a version remain available under this License for the duration
of the licensed rights while you comply. Later project licenses or price changes
do not retroactively revoke compliant permissions or amend a signed agreement.

If you violate a condition, stop the noncompliant activity immediately; your
permissions under this License are suspended. For a first violation they are
reinstated when you fully correct the violation within 30 days after written
notice from the affected Licensor. Otherwise reinstatement requires that
Licensor's written permission. Reinstatement does not erase claims concerning
past unauthorized use. The commercial price is not an automatic contractual
penalty, damages award, or retroactive permission for a violation.

